id: pm-2589e6
title: Full-item stdin JSON update silently ignores edited notes
description: Published 2026.9.28 returns changed_field_count=0 for a changed notes array while preserving the old note; successful no-op conceals stale evidence.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T00:19:58.543Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T08:09:24.273Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-29T06:50:53.619Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-29T06:50:53.619Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Changed notes are atomically audited or rejected with a field-specific error; Disposable get-modify-update regression proves no false successful no-op
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: 85
severity: medium
resolution: "Full-item JSON updates now compare persisted comments, notes, and learnings under the item lock and return a stable actionable refusal for edits or removals; new entries still append."
expected_result: Edited existing notes cannot silently succeed or change item state.
actual_result: "Disposable structured-mutation regression rejects edited note with unchanged verified history; linked test, full suite, exact coverage, and static quality pass."
affected_version: 2026.9.28
component: CLI structured mutations
